  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sponsorship program for 1,000 children in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within 9 years of operation, project A New Page of Life has supported 229 children to get birth certificates so that they can have access to education and children&apos;s basic rights; more than 2,100 children are supported in education, health, and nutrition in HCMC.  Following previous successes, we aim to continue to support nearly 1,000 orphans, disadvantaged, and disabled children and youth in HCMC and Hanoi in 2023 by providing opportunities for them to access education, health, and nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
